    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="0761" n="641" xml:id="pg641"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Clayton to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-03-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 18, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2711.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I inclose a copy and translation of a note from Mr. Mariscal of the 15th ultimo,
                    stating that before replying to my note therein referred to he had considered it
                    expedient to transmit the same, as well as its inclosures, to the governor of
                    the State of Sonora for report. This report having been received by Mr. Mariscal
                    and a copy transmitted to me, with his note of the 16th instant, I inclose a
                    copy and translation of both.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>





